{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>今晨（12日）7時許，警方接獲一名男子報案，有3名男子在秀茂坪曉光街42號對開持木棍襲擊一名女子，3名男子施襲後逃去。警方接報到場，女事主多處受傷，手部骨折，由救護車送往聯合醫院，警方正調查事件原因。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T03:14:43.634056+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":100,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T02:34:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T04:17:23.174902+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T03:08:05.052692+00:00","content_hash":"aa56e7c7da42f022a8f8749a058a162b76c714f78d225ec0200195b18b4dd0c4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}